; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Crafting (docs/plan/2026-10-15-crafting.md): the owner's recipes, Warcraft III
; and Dota's way -- particular things put together make a better one -- with
; Eternal Return's feel: anywhere, the hero kneels over it two or three seconds
; (his Craft clip, data/world/food.duke) and it drops into his bag. A move, a
; blow or a cast calls it off and nothing is spent.
;
; A recipe: Makes a base, a unique or a Potion (Count of it); Rarity a base's,
; out of 1000, common/magic/rare/epic (an epic on a base is a rare; none:
; common), at the hero's level or Level, whichever is more; From what it takes,
; each "name [count]": a material by its Potion name, a thing by its base's or
; unique's name, *Slot any thing of that slot, #tag any of a Tags line's bases,
; and /M /R /E after a thing a least rarity. Only the backpack is taken from,
; never what he wears, and the least rare that fits first. Frames 30 a second;
; Known from the start, else learnt (a Scroll, or a trigger's flag
; hunar:<Name>); Hero, the hero whose own it is.
;
; The order is the screen's, and the order scrolls teach them in.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Crafting
  Frames = 75
  Scroll = chizma
  Tags = [
    "qilich = xanjar qisqa_qilich keng_qilich uzun_qilich egri_qilich",
    "kamon = kamon uzun_kamon arbalet",
  ]

  Title = Hunar
  LearnWord = "Yangi hunar: %s"
  MissingWord = "Nimadir yetishmayapti"
  UnknownWord = "Bu hunarni bilmaysiz"
  GoldWord = oltin
  SecondsWord = s
  ToLearnWord = "Yana %d hunar o'rganish mumkin: chizmalar savdogarlarda"
  NoneWord = "Hozircha hunar yo'q"

  Recipes = [
